        "blockType": "hero",
        "title": "SEO Consulting",
        "subtitle": "A one-off audit catches today's problem. A growing site needs someone monitoring, prioritizing, and adjusting the technical strategy continuously, not a snapshot taken once a year.",
        "cityName": null,
        "inlineStat": null
      },
      {
        "id": "6a53ff748f92aa73aaf6d3c8",
        "blockName": null,
        "columns": [
          {
            "id": "6a53ff748f92aa73aaf6d3c6",
            "size": "full",
            "enableLink": null,
            "richText": {
              "root": {
                "type": "root",
                "format": "",
                "indent": 0,
                "version": 1,
                "children": [
                  {
                    "tag": "h2",
                    "type": "heading",
                    "format": "",
                    "indent": 0,
                    "version": 1,
                    "children": [
                      {
                        "text": "The report goes stale, the site never stops changing",
                        "type": "text",
                        "version": 1
                      }
                    ],
                    "direction": "ltr"
                  },
                  {
                    "type": "paragraph",
                    "format": "",
                    "indent": 0,
                    "version": 1,
                    "children": [
                      {
                        "text": "An audit report goes out of date fast. A site that changes every week, with releases, migrations, and content updates, needs someone tracking the SEO impact of each change, not a review that happens once a year.",
                        "type": "text",
                        "version": 1
                      }
                    ],
                    "direction": "ltr"
                  },
                  {
                    "type": "paragraph",
                    "format": "",
                    "indent": 0,
                    "version": 1,
                    "children": [
                      {
                        "text": "Most SEO consultants only speak the content side of the language. When the problem lives in the code, like a botched migration or a deploy that broke rendering, those recommendations need translating to someone else, and that's where whole weeks get lost.",
                        "type": "text",
                        "version": 1
                      }
                    ],
                    "direction": "ltr"
                  }
                ],
                "direction": "ltr"
              }
            },
            "link": {
              "type": "reference",
              "newTab": null,
              "url": null,
              "label": null,
              "appearance": "default"
            }
          }
        ],
        "blockType": "content"
      },
      {
        "id": "6a544f71140e75434aba4dd4",
        "blockName": null,
        "blockType": "serviceScopeCard",
        "title": "Scope of this engagement",
        "scope": "Ongoing monitoring of Search Console, rankings, and Core Web Vitals, with review of every release that could affect technical SEO before it ships.",
        "outcome": "A technical roadmap that adjusts based on the site's real data, instead of a fixed plan that goes stale a month after it's written.",
        "timeline": "Ongoing, scoped per engagement"
      },
      {
        "id": "6a53ff748f92aa73aaf6d3cf",
        "blockName": null,
        "links": [
          {
            "id": "6a53ff748f92aa73aaf6d3ce",
            "link": {
              "type": "custom",
              "newTab": null,
              "url": "/contact",
              "label": "Talk about consulting",
              "appearance": "default"
            }
          }
        ],
        "blockType": "callToAction",
        "richText": {
          "root": {
            "type": "root",
            "format": "",
            "indent": 0,
            "version": 1,
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "paragraph",
                "format": "",
                "indent": 0,
                "version": 1,
                "children": [
                  {
                    "text": "If your site changes constantly and you need someone watching technical SEO on an ongoing basis, let's talk about how to structure it.",
                    "type": "text",
                    "version": 1
                  }
                ],
                "direction": "ltr"
              }
            ],
            "direction": "ltr"
          }
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "6a544f71140e75434aba4dd7",
        "blockName": null,
        "columns": [
          {
            "id": "6a544f71140e75434aba4dd5",
            "size": "full",
            "enableLink": null,
            "richText": {
              "root": {
                "type": "root",
                "format": "",
                "indent": 0,
                "version": 1,
                "children": [
                  {
                    "tag": "h3",
                    "type": "heading",
                    "format": "",
                    "indent": 0,
                    "version": 1,
                    "children": [
                      {
                        "text": "What's included",
                        "type": "text",
                        "version": 1
                      }
                    ],
                    "direction": "ltr"
                  },
                  {
                    "type": "paragraph",
                    "format": "",
                    "indent": 0,
                    "version": 1,
                    "children": [
                      {
                        "text": "Ongoing technical strategy: a prioritized roadmap that adjusts based on what the data shows, not a fixed plan written once.",
                        "type": "text",
                        "version": 1
                      }
                    ],
                    "direction": "ltr"
                  },
                  {
                    "type": "paragraph",
                    "format": "",
                    "indent": 0,
                    "version": 1,
                    "children": [
                      {
                        "text": "Search Console, rankings, and Core Web Vitals monitoring over time, to catch regressions before they turn into traffic drops.",
                        "type": "text",
                        "version": 1
                      }
                    ],
                    "direction": "ltr"
                  },
                  {
                    "type": "paragraph",
                    "format": "",
                    "indent": 0,
                    "version": 1,
                    "children": [
                      {
                        "text": "Direct collaboration with your dev and marketing teams. I speak both technical languages, which is uncommon among consultants who only know the content side.",
                        "type": "text",
                        "version": 1
                      }
                    ],
                    "direction": "ltr"
                  },
                  {
                    "type": "paragraph",
                    "format": "",
                    "indent": 0,
                    "version": 1,
                    "children": [
                      {
                        "text": "Review of every release or deploy with potential SEO impact (architecture changes, migrations, redesigns) before it ships, not after.",
                        "type": "text",
                        "version": 1
                      }
                    ],
                    "direction": "ltr"
                  }
                ],
                "direction": "ltr"
              }
            },
            "link": {
              "type": "reference",
              "newTab": null,
              "url": null,
              "label": null,
              "appearance": "default"
            }
          },
          {
            "id": "6a544f71140e75434aba4dd6",
            "size": "full",
            "enableLink": null,
            "richText": {
              "root": {
                "type": "root",
                "format": "",
                "indent": 0,
                "version": 1,
                "children": [
                  {
                    "tag": "h3",
                    "type": "heading",
                    "format": "",
                    "indent": 0,
                    "version": 1,
                    "children": [
                      {
                        "text": "How I work",
                        "type": "text",
                        "version": 1
                      }
                    ],
                    "direction": "ltr"
                  },
                  {
                    "type": "paragraph",
                    "format": "",
                    "indent": 0,
                    "version": 1,
                    "children": [
                      {
                        "text": "Cadence is set based on the site's size and rate of change: from monthly reviews to weekly involvement on projects with frequent releases.",
                        "type": "text",
                        "version": 1
                      }
                    ],
                    "direction": "ltr"
                  },
                  {
                    "type": "paragraph",
                    "format": "",
                    "indent": 0,
                    "version": 1,
                    "children": [
                      {
                        "text": "Every cycle delivers prioritized findings and a clear report of what changed, what got implemented, and what impact it had. No dashboards nobody interprets.",
                        "type": "text",
                        "version": 1
                      }
                    ],
                    "direction": "ltr"
                  },
                  {
                    "type": "paragraph",
                    "format": "",
                    "indent": 0,
                    "version": 1,
                    "children": [
                      {
                        "text": "Since I also build (Next.js, headless CMS), I can review pull requests or implement the technical changes directly, not just recommend them.",
                        "type": "text",
                        "version": 1
                      }
                    ],
                    "direction": "ltr"
                  }
                ],
                "direction": "ltr"
              }
            },
            "link": {
              "type": "reference",
              "newTab": null,
              "url": null,
              "label": null,
              "appearance": "default"
            }
          }
        ],
        "blockType": "content"
      },
